---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import RelatedLinks from '../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site, tel, hoursText } from '../config/site';
import { page } from '../data/pages';
import { faqPage, service } from '../lib/schema';

const path = '/mens-life-coaching-omaha/';
const meta = page(path);
const faqs = [
  { q: 'What is men\'s life coaching?', a: "Men's life coaching is one-on-one coaching built around the pressures most men carry quietly: work, money, marriage, kids, anger and habits. We set a simple plan and meet every week so you keep it. It is practical and direct. You talk, I ask straight questions, and you leave with a few things to do before next time." },
  { q: 'Do I have to be in crisis to work with a coach?', a: "No. Most men I work with are functioning fine on paper. They go to work, pay bills and show up for their kids, but they feel stuck, tired or angry more than they want to. Coaching is for building something better, not for emergencies. If you are in crisis, call or text 988 right now." },
  { q: 'What if I am not a talker?', a: "That is fine. A lot of men are not. We keep it practical: what happened this week, what got in the way, what you will do next. Some men open up more on a walk-and-talk than sitting across a table, so we can do that too. You do not need the right words. Honest ones are enough." },
  { q: 'How often do we meet?', a: "Most men meet weekly. Core Coaching is four 45-minute sessions a month for $249. Starter is two sessions a month for $149, which suits men who need a steady check-in more than a big overhaul. Focused Support gives you four 60-minute sessions for $399. Sessions run evenings and Saturdays." },
  { q: 'Is life coaching for men in Omaha only in person?', a: "No. You can meet in person in Omaha, by video or by phone. In-person sessions happen at your location or a private meeting space by appointment and cost $40 extra to cover the room. Video and phone cost nothing extra and work well for men with long commutes or travel." },
];
const schema = [
  service({ path, name: "Men's Life Coaching in Omaha", serviceType: 'Life coaching for men', description: meta.description }),
  faqPage(path, faqs),
];
---
<Base path={path} crumbs={[{ name: "Men's Life Coaching", path }]} schema={schema}>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Life coaching for men · Omaha, NE" title="Life coaching for men tired of living the same day" lead="Same alarm. Same fights. Same promise to start Monday. If you're done with that loop, let's build a plan you can actually keep." crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: "Men's Life Coaching", path }]} updated={site.contentUpdated}>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn brass" href={site.booking} rel="noopener"><Icon name="calendar" />Book a Free Discovery Call</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href={tel}><Icon name="phone" />Call or Text {site.phone.display}</a>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="hook-h">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <h2 id="hook-h">You know something needs to change. You just haven't changed it.</h2>
      <p>Most men don't call a coach when everything is on fire. They call when they're tired of the slow leak. The job that eats every evening. The short fuse at home. The drinking that's "not a problem" but shows up more than it should. The goals that have been on the list for five years.</p>
      <p>You've probably tried to fix it alone. New planner. New gym membership. A big talk with yourself on Sunday night. Then Tuesday shows up, you're tired, and the old pattern wins again.</p>
      <p>That's not a character flaw. It's what happens when nobody is checking in and the plan only works on good days. A plan matters most when you're angry, tired, broke, lonely, or ready to quit. That's the plan we build.</p>
      <div class="card ppa-note">
        <p><strong>Not sure where you stand?</strong> The free Personal Patterns Assessment takes 5–8 minutes and shows how you handle action, connection, follow-through and decisions. No call required.</p>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/personal-patterns-assessment/">Take the Free Personal Patterns Assessment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section white" aria-labelledby="work-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">What we work on</p>
        <h2 id="work-h">Whatever is actually getting in your way</h2>
        <p>Every man is different, so coaching is too. These are the things that come up most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card"><h3>Direction</h3><p>Getting clear on what you want the next few years to look like, then breaking it down until it fits in a week.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Structure</h3><p>Mornings, evenings, sleep and the basics. Most men feel better fast once the day has a shape again.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Follow-through</h3><p>Small commitments you report back on. Keeping your word to yourself is where self-respect comes back.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Anger and stress</h3><p>Stop before you react. Notice what sets you off and build a pause between the feeling and the words.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Home life</h3><p>Being present with your partner and kids instead of just in the room. Better talks, fewer blowups.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Confidence</h3><p>Less second-guessing. Making a decision, owning it and moving on, even when you're not sure.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="sessions-h">
    <div class="wrap grid-2 top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How sessions work</p>
        <h2 id="sessions-h">Evenings, Saturdays, and wherever works for you</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>We start with a free 20-minute call. If it's a fit, the first session maps your week and picks the two or three changes that matter most. After that we meet weekly or every other week, depending on your plan.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><strong>In person</strong> at your location or a private meeting space in Omaha, by appointment. Some men prefer a walk-and-talk on the Keystone Trail or around Zorinsky Lake.</li>
          <li><strong>Video</strong> from home, the office or the truck.</li>
          <li><strong>Phone</strong> when that's all you have time for.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Hours:</strong> {hoursText}. I keep evenings and Saturdays open because most men can't leave work at 2 PM to talk about their life.</p>
        <p>See how <a href="/omaha-life-coach/">coaching across Omaha</a> works and <a href="/pricing/">what each plan costs</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dark grain" aria-labelledby="change-h">
    <div class="wrap grid-2 top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What changes</p>
        <h2 id="change-h">Small, boring wins that add up</h2>
        <p>I won't promise you a new life in 30 days. Nobody honest can. Here's what men usually notice when they keep showing up:</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Evenings at home are calmer and shorter on blowups.</li>
        <li>You keep more of the promises you make, starting with the small ones.</li>
        <li>Mornings have a plan, so the day stops running you.</li>
        <li>You make decisions faster and second-guess less.</li>
        <li>Your partner and kids notice you're actually there.</li>
        <li>Bad days still happen. They just don't wreck the whole week.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="not-h">
    <div class="wrap grid-2 top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Honest fit</p>
        <h2 id="not-h">Who this is not for</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <ul class="x-list">
          <li>Men who want someone to agree with them every week. I'll be respectful, and I'll be straight.</li>
          <li>Men looking for a quick fix or a guaranteed result.</li>
          <li data-scope>Anyone in crisis or needing mental health care, medical care or therapy. Call or text 988 for crisis help, and I can point you to licensed professionals.</li>
          <li>Men who are only here because someone made them. Coaching only works if you choose it.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Skeptical? Good. Plenty of men come in not believing in any of this. That's fine. Give it a free 20 minutes and decide for yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section white" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 id="faq-h">Life coaching for men: common questions</h2></div>
      <Faq faqs={faqs} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <RelatedLinks heading="Other ways I help" links={[
    { href: '/accountability-coaching/', title: 'Accountability coaching in Omaha', text: 'For men who start strong and slip. Habits, check-ins and a plan for bad days.' },
    { href: '/coaching-for-fathers/', title: 'Coaching for fathers and husbands', text: 'Be present at home, calmer under pressure and someone your family can count on.' },
    { href: '/about/', title: "About Roland Nielson", text: 'North Omaha, juvenile detention, 2011, four boys. Why I coach men the way I do.' },
  ]} />
</Base>
<style>
  .ppa-note { margin-top: var(--space-m); display: grid; gap: 1rem; justify-items: start; }
  .ppa-note p { margin: 0; }
</style>
